WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:02.670
- So the Lincoln Project
has accused Rudy Giuliani

00:00:02.670 --> 00:00:05.070
of defaming them in an
interview with Steve Bannon.

00:00:05.070 --> 00:00:06.930
- The defense is going to have to show

00:00:06.930 --> 00:00:08.070
that this thing was planned

00:00:08.070 --> 00:00:10.190
and that a lot of the people
involved in the planning,

00:00:10.190 --> 00:00:11.790
ANTIFA, and then even
some right-wing groups

00:00:11.790 --> 00:00:13.520
were enemies of his, and
that they were doing it

00:00:13.520 --> 00:00:14.353
in order to hurt him,

00:00:14.353 --> 00:00:15.590
including some right-wing groups

00:00:15.590 --> 00:00:17.370
that operate for the Lincoln Project.

00:00:17.370 --> 00:00:18.950
- Reminder, Rudy would have to say

00:00:18.950 --> 00:00:21.380
some objectively
verifiable, false statement

00:00:21.380 --> 00:00:22.213
about the Lincoln Project.

00:00:22.213 --> 00:00:23.940
This is pretty broad so far.

00:00:23.940 --> 00:00:25.200
- One of the people involved

00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:27.580
brought in right-wing
groups that opposed Trump.

00:00:27.580 --> 00:00:28.807
He had the same motivation
the ANTIFA people had.

00:00:28.807 --> 00:00:30.620
And the biggest problems,
violent problems,

00:00:30.620 --> 00:00:31.607
were caused by ANTIFA.

00:00:31.607 --> 00:00:32.540
That's where the shooting took place.

00:00:32.540 --> 00:00:34.440
- I mean, that's completely false, but,

00:00:34.440 --> 00:00:36.160
you know, Rudy is just
gonna make stuff up.

00:00:36.160 --> 00:00:37.970
- But who is the guy working
with the Lincoln Project?

00:00:37.970 --> 00:00:39.770
- I don't know if I can reveal his name,

00:00:39.770 --> 00:00:41.730
because we have have that
from anonymous sources.

00:00:41.730 --> 00:00:43.550
- When Steve Bannon is laughing at you,

00:00:43.550 --> 00:00:45.050
you know you're a complete wacko

00:00:45.050 --> 00:00:46.760
and you've lost the room here.

00:00:46.760 --> 00:00:48.710
I'm not sure that this
gives rise to defamation.

00:00:48.710 --> 00:00:50.590
Also, what damages would
the Lincoln Project

00:00:50.590 --> 00:00:51.530
have suffered here?

00:00:51.530 --> 00:00:53.140
If the Lincoln project does
follow through with this,

00:00:53.140 --> 00:00:54.870
this is going to be
performative litigation,

00:00:54.870 --> 00:00:56.730
the kind that I hate from
both sides of the aisle.

00:00:56.730 --> 00:00:59.130
But anyway, subscribe,
or I'll see you in court.

